# tiny

## public.users

People who can sign in.

| column | type | null | default | key | comment |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| id | BIGINT | NO |  | PK |  |
| email | TEXT | NO |  |  |  |
| created_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | NO | now() |  |  |

Indexes:
- UNIQUE (email)

## public.user_profiles

| column | type | null | default | key | comment |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| user_id | BIGINT | NO |  | PK, FK → public.users.id |  |
| display_name | TEXT | NO |  |  |  |

Foreign keys:
- (user_id) → public.users(id), on delete CASCADE, one-to-one

## public.coupons

| column | type | null | default | key | comment |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| id | BIGINT | NO |  | PK |  |
| code | TEXT | NO |  |  |  |

Indexes:
- UNIQUE (code)

## public.orders

| column | type | null | default | key | comment |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| id | BIGINT | NO |  | PK |  |
| user_id | BIGINT | NO |  | FK → public.users.id |  |
| coupon_id | BIGINT | YES |  | FK → public.coupons.id |  |
| status | public.order_status | NO | 'pending' |  |  |
| total | NUMERIC(12,2) | NO | 0 |  | Gross total, in the order currency. |

Foreign keys:
- (user_id) → public.users(id), on delete CASCADE, many-to-one
- (coupon_id) → public.coupons(id), on delete SET NULL, many-to-one, optional

Indexes:
- (user_id) `orders_user_id_idx`

## public.order_receipts

| column | type | null | default | key | comment |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| id | BIGINT | NO |  | PK |  |
| order_id | BIGINT | YES |  | FK → public.orders.id |  |
| issued_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | NO | now() |  |  |

Foreign keys:
- (order_id) → public.orders(id), one-to-one, optional

Indexes:
