## public.order_items

| column | type | null | default | key | comment |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| order_id | BIGINT | NO |  | PK, FK → public.orders.id |  |
| product_id | BIGINT | NO |  | PK |  |
| quantity | INTEGER | NO | 1 |  |  |

Foreign keys:
